# Trivy ignore list for .github/workflows/security.yml (filesystem/dependency scan).
#
# Every entry MUST have, on the comment lines directly above it:
#   - a reason (why it cannot be fixed or does not apply), and
#   - a tracking link (GitHub issue or upstream advisory) saying when to remove it.
# Entries without both are rejected in review. Remove an entry as soon as the
# upstream fix is available.
#
# Format: one advisory ID per line (CVE-... or GHSA-...).

# Dev tooling only (Metro bundler, not the app runtime); awaiting upstream fix.
